Package: brmDE
Title: Gene-wise Bayesian Differential Expression with brms
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stefano", "Mangiola", email = "mangiolastefano@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Fit, test, and adjust one gene at a time using brms count
    models. An HPCell pipeline composes estimate, hypothesis, and adjust
    onto the same targets graph.
